<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>HotNews — 中國，每一天。</title><description>Daily stories from China in technology, finance, sports, entertainment, lifestyle, science, travel and culture — for readers around the world.</description><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/</link><language>zh-TW</language><item><title>AI 主導精密投資詐騙</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-ai-takes-over-sophisticated-investment-scams/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-ai-takes-over-sophisticated-investment-scams/</guid><description>中國投資者面臨新一波 AI 驅動的金融詐騙，因人工智慧能實現更精密的「養豬騙局」，誘騙受害者轉帳大筆資金。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>economy</category><category>finance</category><category>daily-life</category></item><item><title>中國智慧手機巨頭轉換晶片供應商</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-smartphone-giants-switch-chip-suppliers/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-smartphone-giants-switch-chip-suppliers/</guid><description>中國主要手機製造商OPPO和vivo出人意料地轉向使用MediaTek晶片旗艦型號，標示著在激烈競爭中產業的轉變。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>exports</category><category>economy</category></item><item><title>大金剛的最終香蕉狂歡節讓玩家樂在其中</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260924-games-donkey-kongs-final-banana-bash-delights/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260924-games-donkey-kongs-final-banana-bash-delights/</guid><description>任天堂透過《大金剛：香蕉天堂》中的「香蕉狂歡嘉年華」擴充內容，為一週年的主題活動畫下句點。這為期一周的活動為玩家在1400樓地下層提供不間斷的挑戰。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>technology</category><category>entertainment</category></item><item><title>Vivo 推出搭載先進 MediaTek 處理器的 X500</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260924-tech-vivo-unveils-x500-with-cutting-edge-mediatek/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260924-tech-vivo-unveils-x500-with-cutting-edge-mediatek/</guid><description>中國手機製造商 vivo 推出其最新旗艦型號，搭載新的晶片，持續中國在行動技術上的創新。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>exports</category><category>economy</category></item><item><title>中國茶文化在現代時代的傳承</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260923-culture-chinas-tea-traditions-in-modern-times/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260923-culture-chinas-tea-traditions-in-modern-times/</guid><description>從古代儀式到當代茶館，中國五千年的茶文化在不斷演進的同時，也保留了其深厚的傳統。</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>culture</category><category>tradition</category><category>daily-life</category><category>cities</category><category>travel-guide</category></item><item><title>中國傳統皮影戲的古老藝術與現代光影相遇</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260923-culture-the-ancient-art-of-chinese-shadow/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260923-culture-the-ancient-art-of-chinese-shadow/</guid><description>中國皮影戲是一種使用精雕細琢的皮革人偶來講述故事的千年傳統，目前正在經歷文化復興。當代藝術家和劇院通過將經典故事與現代燈光和數位投影技術相結合，來保存這項被聯合國教科文組織認可的藝術形式。</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>culture</category><category>tradition</category><category>animation</category><category>daily-life</category></item><item><title>中國動產業捕捉全球想像力</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260923-entertainment-chinese-animation-industry-captures-global-imagination/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260923-entertainment-chinese-animation-industry-captures-global-imagination/</guid><description>中國動產業已從國內製作演變為國際公認的作品，將傳統文化元素與尖端技術相結合，贏得了全球觀眾的青睞。</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>animation</category><category>film</category><category>culture</category><category>technology</category><category>exports</category></item><item><title>中國咖啡之都攪動全球金融熱潮</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260923-finance-chinas-coffee-capital-brews-a-global/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260923-finance-chinas-coffee-capital-brews-a-global/</guid><description>上海已悄然成為全球最密集的咖啡市場，將日常的咖啡因習慣轉變為激烈的商業競技場。隨著全球基金將資金投入本土連鎖店，這波飲品熱潮正引起主要消費金融的密切關注。</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>coffee</category><category>economy</category><category>cities</category><category>daily-life</category></item><item><title>Beats 360：重新定義無線音體驗</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260923-lifestyle-beats-360-redefining-wireless-audio-experience/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260923-lifestyle-beats-360-redefining-wireless-audio-experience/</guid><description>蘋果的音響品牌Beats推出其三年來首款新的頭戴式耳機Beats 360，結合高級音質與創新設計，標誌著音響創新的二十年里程碑。</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>daily-life</category><category>fashion</category></item><item><title>中國的量子躍進：引領下一場計算革命</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260923-science-chinas-quantum-leap-leading-the-next/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260923-science-chinas-quantum-leap-leading-the-next/</guid><description>中國在量子計算技術方面的快速進展，使其成為計算科學下一個前沿領域的關鍵參與者，其突破性成果可能改變全球各行各業。</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>research</category><category>high-speed-rail</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>exports</category></item><item><title>中國的跑步革命：馬拉松文化興盛</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260923-sports-chinas-running-revolution-marathon-culture-blooms/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260923-sports-chinas-running-revolution-marathon-culture-blooms/</guid><description>曾經是一個自行車王國，中國現在以前所未有的熱情擁抱馬拉松，創造了世界上最大、最充滿活力的跑步社群之一。</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>running</category><category>fitness</category><category>cities</category><category>daily-life</category><category>culture</category></item><item><title>中國發射衛星星際網路星座</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260923-tech-china-launches-satellite-internet-constellation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260923-tech-china-launches-satellite-internet-constellation/</guid><description>中國成功部署了另一批低地球軌道衛星，繼續其雄心勃勃的基於太空的網路項目，發射了26個衛星組。</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>space</category><category>research</category><category>technology</category></item><item><title>中國高鐵網絡連接古今</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260923-travel-chinas-high-speed-rail-network-connects-ancient/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260923-travel-chinas-high-speed-rail-network-connects-ancient/</guid><description>不斷擴展的中國高鐵網絡改變了這個世界人口最多國家的旅行方式，以前所未有的速度將歷史景點與現代城市連接起來。</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>high-speed-rail</category><category>travel-guide</category><category>cities</category><category>daily-life</category><category>culture</category></item><item><title>中國 C919：自製客機飛向更多天空</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260922-tech-c919/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260922-tech-c919/</guid><description>由中國商飛研製的窄體客機 C919，正從首批商業航線走向日益壯大的機隊。一起來看這款中國指標性客機的門道，以及搭起來是什麼感覺。</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>aviation</category><category>c919</category><category>manufacturing</category></item><item><title>中國電動車出口正在改寫全球汽車版圖</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260921-finance-ev-exports/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260921-finance-ev-exports/</guid><description>中國已是全球最大汽車出口國，領頭的是比亞迪、奇瑞與一票新興品牌的電動與插電混動車——這股浪潮正深刻影響各地的車價。</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>exports</category><category>economy</category></item><item><title>馬拉松熱：跑步如何成為中國人的週末儀式</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260920-sports-marathon-boom/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260920-sports-marathon-boom/</guid><description>從要抽籤才能參加的都市馬拉松，到山區的越野賽，數千萬中國跑者把週末賽事變成全民休閒。</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>marathon</category><category>running</category><category>fitness</category></item><item><title>強片與紀錄：中國動畫長大了</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260919-entertainment-chinese-animation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260919-entertainment-chinese-animation/</guid><description>從《哪吒》系列的票房神話，到新一代工作室的崛起，中國動畫電影已成為國內票房的強權——並把目光投向海外觀眾。</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>animation</category><category>film</category><category>box-office</category></item><item><title>茶之國度愛上咖啡</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260918-lifestyle-coffee-culture/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/lifestyle/20260918-lifestyle-coffee-culture/</guid><description>中國如今坐擁全球最大的咖啡市場之一。從上海精品烘焙到 App 點單連鎖，咖啡已悄悄融入都市日常。</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>coffee</category><category>cities</category><category>daily-life</category></item><item><title>天宮：中國空間站上的生活與科學</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260917-science-tiangong/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/science/20260917-science-tiangong/</guid><description>三組太空人輪流常駐的天宮空間站，正進行數百項實驗——並向世界各國的科學載荷敞開艙門。</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>space</category><category>tiangong</category><category>research</category></item><item><title>以時速 350 公里看中國：實用高鐵指南</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260916-travel-high-speed-rail/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/travel/20260916-travel-high-speed-rail/</guid><description>超過 4.5 萬公里高速鐵路連起大都會與古城，搭高鐵是旅人暢遊中國最快的方式。這是使用攻略。</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>high-speed-rail</category><category>travel-guide</category><category>cities</category></item><item><title>漢服復興：年輕中國重新穿上傳統服飾</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260915-culture-hanfu-revival/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260915-culture-hanfu-revival/</guid><description>城市公園裡飄逸的衣袖、漢服寫真館、數十億元人民幣的市場——中國傳統服飾已從戲服走向日常時尚。</description><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>hanfu</category><category>fashion</category><category>tradition</category></item></channel></rss>